        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-019-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-019-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-019-the-forms-of-tissues-or-cell-a-audit-thompson1917-t1917-019-1>,
